scan of <root>
add   shop.test      127.0.1.1
add   api.shop.test  127.0.1.1
add   web.shop.test  127.0.1.1  port 3001
link  ./docker/compose.dev.yaml
env   DOCKER_HOST_IP=127.0.1.1
env   API_URL=http://web.shop.test
env   DATABASE_URL=postgres://***@shop.test:5432/shop
note  api.shop.test: lodo can't tell its port; set it in lodo dev --edit

run lodo dev --edit here to add and link these

lodo dev and lodo exec set the env lines; the .env files stay as they are
